\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">age_limit</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-0lZTAQ28\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Kh7VZ1Uk\">年龄限制</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-QDTW35Si\">可选值:</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-B5hBXaY7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-INePSYME\"><code>EIGHTEEN_PLUS</code> 18+</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Lla4jCOC\"><code>EIGHT_PLUS</code> 8+</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-T9O8C8E0\"><code>FOUR_PLUS</code> 4+</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VS2FTfLD\"><code>SIXTEEN_PLUS</code> 16+</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-j3p4f5bI\"><code>TWELVE_PLUS</code> 12+</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">revenue_model</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VhFw4HPg\">变现模式</p> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-7PZ6iC0f\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-oKTWQ78m\"><code>IAA</code> 营销</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VEoYcjJm\"><code>IAAP</code> 混合</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-At9IYg4o\"><code>IAP</code> 付费</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">has_online_earning</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-STQCnObD\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-wFAobgor\">是否包含网赚内容</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">min_payment_tier_range</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MQKZ31jY\">最低付费档位区间（元）</p> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-OkN4M15B\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uKSQBSdO\"><code>SIX_TEN</code> 6~10</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4C1fj39B\"><code>TEN_TWENTY</code> 10~20</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-f5JGCeOA\"><code>TWENTY_FIFTY</code> 20~50</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-lR6qse0V\"><code>ZERO_FIVE</code> 0~5</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">mid_payment_tier_range</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yDj3kzO1\">中间付费档位区间（元）</p> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-b2ViW3CO\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0vmP85bK\"><code>ABOVE_500</code> 500以上</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-zP7IOgjr\"><code>BELOW_100</code> 100以下</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RC3r3z2m\"><code>FROM_100_TO_500</code> 100~500</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">max_payment_tier_range</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tnV2v58j\">最高付费档位区间（元）</p> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-cBLhjMTq\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BkiY7VXh\"><code>ABOVE_1000</code> 1000以上</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MYHDIAVw\"><code>BELOW_500</code> 500以下</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-F4C8fLcf\"><code>FROM_500_TO_1000</code> 500-1000</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">schedule_cards</p></section